 "title": "Welcome to Ellsworth County, KS",
 "text": "Welcome to Ellsworth County, KS\nGO\nSearch\nHome\nGovernment\nCounty Attorney\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty Clerk\nDistrict Court\nCounty Register of Deeds\nSheriff's Office\nCo Treasurer - DMV & Property Tax\nDepartments\nAppraisers\nEconomic Development\nEmergency Management\nEMS\nMidway Extension District 15\nHealth Department\nRoad and Bridge\nResidents\nArchives\nCounty Information\nElections\nCounty Bulletin Board\nMajor Employers\nNoxious Weed & Landfill\nRecycling\nTownships\nNews & Job Openings\nCo Treasurer - DMV & Property Tax\nCo Treasurer - DMV & Property Tax\nSub Menu\nRelated\nPages\nTreasurer\nProperty Taxes\nDriver's License Contact Info\n50 State's Certificates\nCommonly Used Forms\nLevy Sheets\nQuarterly Reports\nHome › Government › Co Treasurer - DMV & Property Tax\nShelby Soukup\nEllsworth County Treasurer\nDeputy Treasurer: Amanda Ellis\nClerk: Braeden Sheridan-Stroede\nClerk: Javon Rice\nOffice Hours are 8 am to 5 pm Monday through Friday\n**We ask people to try to come in by 4:30,\nas we stop doing transactions at 4:45 everyday so that we can\nrun end of day reports and balance funds.\nPhysical / Mailing Address :\n210 N Kansas Ave\nEllsworth, KS 67439\nPhone: 785-472-4152\nFax: 785-472-3818\nEmail Contacts:\nOffice - ewtreas@ellsworthcounty.org\nShelby - shelby@ellsworthcounty.org\nAmanda - amanda@ellsworthcounty.org\nBraeden - braeden@ellsworthcounty.org\nJavon - jrice@ellsworthcounty.org\nProperty Tax information can be found in the left navigation panel\nDriver's License & ID Cards\nF or information on Real ID , https://www.ksrevenue.gov/dovrealid.html\nHandbooks: You can purchase handbooks in office for $2.00 each, or view them online using the following links\nDriving handbook\nMotorcycle handbook\nCDL handbook\nKansas Online Driver's License Test\nhttps://knowtodrive.ks.gov/\nFees charged for Driver's License / ID Processing\nMotor vehicle report (driving record) for $10\nInformation on teen driver's graduated license rules\nOnline Address Change for Driver's License\nMotor Vehicle\nTitle and registration on new purchase vehicles & trailers\nTitle only for Mobile homes & ATV's\nRenew yearly registration on vehicles & trailers\nReplace titles & lost/stolen license plates or registration stickers\nIssue Disabled placards & License plates\nChange vehicles & trailers from another state to Kansas title & registration\nAdd & Remove liens from vehicles & trailers\nCollect Sales tax on brand new watercraft purchased out of State\nKansas Registration Renewal Dates according to the 1st letter of last name, except\nFarm/Heavy truck/non-RV trailer/Commerical Vehicles are due last business day of February each year\n2025 License Plate Guide\nPersonalized plate order form\nLicense plate renewals can be done on the iKan portal\nHelpful Links\nOrder motor vehicle records\nDriver's License Status Check\nCommercial Vehicle Resource\nOrgan Donation Info\nPersonalized Plate Lookup\nHelpful Forms\nhttp://www.ksrevenue.org/dovforms.html#tr3\nhttps://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-pdf/f2290.pdf for your 2025-2026 IRS 2290\n© 2017 Ellsworth County, KS\n210 N Kansas Ave Ellsworth KS 67439\nPowered By\nRevize\nLogin\n×\nShare this page\nCopy and past this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://ellsworthcounty.org/government/treasurer/index.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nGoogle Plus\nReddit\nClose",
